                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "looks exactly like towerfall ascension with extremely similar mechanics like the dodging while in air, grabbing on to the sides of walls, arrows shoot very similarly and stick to the walls, and of course the dropping down through the level to be falling from the top (but lots of games have that). the thing that separates this from towerfall is the lack of content and updates. i dont believe this game is being made anymore. straight up i havent seen an update on it for a long time. and at least from the video, towerfall has so much more content. i think someone ripped off someone and this game isnt looking to be made anymore than its current, extremely bugged state.",
